        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 2.3MW, onshore, foundation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 2.3MW, onshore, foundation
UUID=d83334f0-598b-43fe-bb2b-d8deff11b7cb
Wind turbine foundation, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the Enercon E-82 2.3MW onshore wind turbine (Enercon, 2011).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
