Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d83334f0-598b-43fe-bb2b-d8deff11b7cb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
